  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Here, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>'</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mtext>x</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mtext>x</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mtext>x</mtext><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext>,</mtext><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Then, situations for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>'</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is as follow :<br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0113_cc3e0db5049c.jpg\" /><br /><br />Given that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> decreases in the largest possible interval<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mtext>,</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math> then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>'</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> must have roots <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><mo>&rArr;</mo> Product of roots is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math><math> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mi>&#955;</mi> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>&#8658;</mo> <mi>&#955;</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mn>4</mn> </mrow> </math>"
  }
